    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "Defaults, as shipped",
      "description": "**Everything here is a default.** No option is set beyond the chart type.\n\n- Force layout spread by `repulsion: 400` / `edgeLength: 200`; ECharts' own `[0,50]` / `30` pack a real topology into a knot in the middle of the panel.\n- Node positions are **reproducible**: the simulation is seeded on a ring (`force.initLayout`) where ECharts seeds it at `Math.random()`, so this graph is the same on every refresh instead of shuffling.\n- The simulation's steps are **not painted** (`force.layoutAnimation: false`), so a refresh does not jiggle.\n- Arrowheads at the target end, since an edge is directed by contract.\n- Hover a node: adjacency highlighting is on, and Default-tier rather than Advanced.\n- Labels truncate at 120px and any that would still collide are dropped.",
