    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "grafana-echartsrelations-panel",
      "title": "Link colour: Source",
      "description": "Each link takes the colour of the node it leaves.\n\n**The bug.** ECharts' `graph` series resolves the `source` / `target` keywords in `edgeVisual` at visual priority 3000, but the pass that applies each node's own `itemStyle.color` runs at 4500 — so the keyword read a colour the nodes did not have yet and *every* edge came out the same palette blue, whichever mode was picked. The panel resolves the endpoint colours itself now.",
